DESCRIPTION:Weekly robotics class on Tuesdays\n\nTranscribed audio from judell:\nBloomington North. So robotics class\, Bloomington High School North\, Tuesdays at 4 o'clock. Just to have something in there. I mean\, yeah\, this part in itself is amazing. Does the scraper look for some of my community's kind of rural? I just wonder for rural communities\, things like the agriculture or 4H. Anything. It reminds all that sort of stuff. Those are the kinds of things that we would add in to the playbook as we go along\, because we haven't encountered 4H stuff yet. But absolutely\, let's look for it. One of the things that's cool about the paper posters\, just go around town and take a picture.
